na has  denied the claims last week its  ambassador to the United Kingdom called  them fake news I'm telling you what you  the document so-called doctrine you're  talking about is a pure fabrications  don't listen to fake news  don't listen to fabrications a rare  comment from China on the detention  centers but as more details emerge of  what goes on here more questions will be  asked of the international community to  look closer  Kimberly Leonard sky news
 

